  "description": "Back end only for Dotnet Report, the embedded analytics and ad-hoc reporting solution for ASP.NET Core.\n\n      This package contains the server code: the API controller, the report model with Excel, Word and PDF export, and the scheduled report job, along with the NuGet libraries they need. It has no JavaScript, CSS, Razor views or page controllers.\n\n      Use it in your .NET API project when your solution keeps the UI and the API in separate projects, together with dotnetreport.frontend in the web project. It also works on its own behind the dotnetreport Angular or React front end. For a single-project install, use the full dotnetreport package.",
