  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "6.4.0\n      - Permissions without Admin Mode (Manage Access, Manage Headers & Footers, View Report SQL, Manage Users, View Only) enforced on the server, and settable in code with settings.Permissions.\n      - API for the Users & Access page: Dotnet Report Managed users, roles and tenants.\n      - Workspace, connection and email settings read from appsettings.dotnetreport.json (secrets encrypted), falling back to appsettings.json. Scheduled emails use them.\n      - Fixes: PDF export no longer times out on rich text, links or quotes in values; number formats in exports on databases other than SQL Server; deleting a folder checks access.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "verbatimVersion": "6.4.0",
